  "title": {
    "zh": "儿童积木帐篷建筑游戏屋套装",
    "en": "Kids Fort Building Playhouse Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款儿童积木帐篷建筑游戏屋套装，采用PP结构件，适用于家庭互动、课程活动和创意拼搭场景。\n\n产地为东莞茶山，适用年龄段为4-6岁，支持拆装重构与多场景使用。",
    "en": "This is a kids fort building playhouse set made with PP structural parts, suitable for family interaction, educational activities, and creative construction scenarios.\n\nProduced in Chashan, Dongguan, it is designed for ages 4-6 and supports repeatable assembly and multi-scenario use."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款儿童积木帐篷建筑游戏屋套装采用模块化拼插结构，可用于帐篷、通道和互动空间等形态搭建，适合儿童持续创意构建。",
      "产品适用于亲子互动、启蒙教学和活动空间布置，通过拼搭过程帮助提升手眼协调、动手能力与协作体验。",
      "包装为彩盒，配套体积与尺寸参数完整，便于渠道上架、仓配管理和项目采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This kids fort building playhouse set uses a modular interlocking structure and supports layouts such as tents, tunnels, and interactive spaces for continuous creative construction play.",
      "It is suitable for parent-child interaction, early educational activities, and event-space setup, helping improve hand-eye coordination, hands-on ability, and collaborative experience.",
      "The set uses color-box packaging with complete volume and size data for channel listing, warehouse operations, and project procurement."
    ]
  },
